        '6-8', $q$Our School Needs a Cross-Country Team$q$, $q$(1) Westbrook Middle School should start a cross-country team next fall. (2) Unlike soccer or basketball, cross-country does not cut anyone from the roster, so every student who wants to run can join. (3) The sport also costs very little to run. (4) Runners need only good shoes, and the school already owns stopwatches from gym class. (5) A dirt trail already circles the park behind the school, so the team would not need to build a new field or track.

