   $q$Which sentence would best replace sentence 5 to connect the second paragraph to the first?$q$, $q$[{"text":"In conclusion, the club wanted the mural to celebrate many cultures.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"conclusion-misplaced"},{"text":"Once the design was ready, the club faced a new challenge: paying for supplies.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Meanwhile, the club was still waiting for the survey results to come in.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-sequence"},{"text":"Paint and brushes can be very expensive at most stores in the area.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"no-link-to-previous"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Once the design was ready, the club faced a new challenge: paying for supplies.$q$, $q$The correct sentence points back to the finished design from paragraph 1 and introduces the money problem that paragraph 2 explains. The "Meanwhile" choice contradicts sentence 4, which already says the survey answers came in and the sketch was made.$q$, 'draft', '430ece17-0975-546f-a5d8-9398b9ddca3f')
