   $q$The writer wants to add a sentence after sentence 9 to conclude the whole passage. Which sentence would work best?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Six weekends is a very long time to spend on any one school project.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"narrow-detail-conclusion"},{"text":"Bookmarks were the best-selling item at the fall concert that year.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"minor-detail-conclusion"},{"text":"Next year, the club might paint a second mural in the gym instead.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"new-topic-conclusion"},{"text":"When the last coat dried, the gray wall had become a picture of the whole school.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$When the last coat dried, the gray wall had become a picture of the whole school.$q$, $q$The correct sentence returns to the gray wall from sentence 1 and the goal of showing every student's culture, so it wraps up both paragraphs. The sentence about six weekends only comments on one detail from sentence 9.$q$, 'draft', '430ece17-0975-546f-a5d8-9398b9ddca3f')
