  ('2daf7b6e-f051-5850-9d11-79cd08455025', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g8-paragraph-transitions'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Read: "Spiders are often mistaken for insects. ____, they belong to a different group of animals, since they have eight legs instead of six." Which transition best completes the sentences?$q$, $q$[{"text":"As a result,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-cause"},{"text":"In reality,","is_correct":true},{"text":"Likewise,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"similarity-for-correction"},{"text":"For example,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-for-correction"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In reality,$q$, $q$The second sentence corrects the mistaken belief in the first, so "In reality" fits. "As a result" is wrong because people mistaking spiders for insects does not cause spiders to belong to a different group.$q$, 'draft', null)
